OL,3,GNEWSADate set for town's anti-social
OL,4,Abehaviour crackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeasures which aim to clampdown on
OL,7,Fanti-social behaviour in Woking town
OL,8,Fcentre will come into force from 28
OL,9,FOctober, the local council has said.
OL,11,FWoking Borough Council said the public
OL,12,Fspaces protection order (PSPO) will set
OL,13,F"clear expectations for behaviours" in
OL,14,Fthe town.
OL,16,FThe order bans alcohol-related
OL,17,Fintimidation, threatening or disruptive
OL,18,Fgroup behaviour and face coverings used
OL,19,Fto cause fear or hide the identity of
OL,20,Fpeople acting anti-socially.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
